---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import NavyDot from '../components/NavyDot.astro';
---
<Base title="Design System Test -- Neil Raman">
  <h1>Design System Test</h1>
  <p>This page exercises every design token to verify the design system works end-to-end.</p>

  <section>
    <h2>Type Scale</h2>
    <h1>Heading 1 -- Lora Serif at 2.747rem</h1>
    <h2>Heading 2 -- Lora Serif at 2.197rem</h2>
    <h3>Heading 3 -- Lora Serif at 1.758rem</h3>
    <h4>Heading 4 -- Lora Serif at 1.406rem</h4>
    <p>Body text in Inter sans-serif at 18px base. The line-height is set to 1.6 for comfortable reading. This paragraph tests that the body font, size, color, and spacing tokens all render correctly. Good typography and whitespace are the product.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="dot-separator">
    <NavyDot />
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Colors and Links</h2>
    <p>This is a <a href="https://neilraman.com">deep navy link</a> demonstrating the accent color token. Hover to see the darker state.</p>
    <p class="muted-text">This paragraph uses the muted color token for secondary information.</p>
    <hr class="rule" />
    <p>The horizontal rule above uses the <code>--color-rule</code> token.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="dot-separator">
    <NavyDot />
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Spacing and Layout</h2>
    <p>Content is constrained to approximately 720px (45rem) with horizontal padding on both sides. On narrow viewports, the padding prevents text from touching screen edges.</p>
    <p>The spacing scale uses an 8px base with balanced progression: 4px, 8px, 16px, 24px, 32px, 48px, 64px, 96px.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  section h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  section p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .dot-separator {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .muted-text {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    margin: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  code {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    background-color: var(--color-rule);
    padding: 0.1em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
</style>
